        "original_id": "02c0bc24-8d1c-5671-b502-18c88d6d3214",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Geoffrey S. Fletcher, Saoirse Ronan, Alexis Bledel, Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Danny Trejo, James Gandolfini, Julio DePietro, Scott Porter, Bryan Greenberg\n- Films: Violet & Daisy, Precious, The Good Guy\n- TV Series: The Handmaid's Tale\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Adapted Screenplay, Primetime Emmy Award\n\nFacts:\n- The Good Guy is a 2009 romantic comedy film directed by Julio DePietro and starring Alexis Bledel, Scott Porter, and Bryan Greenberg.\n- Violet & Daisy is a 2011 American comedy crime drama film written, produced, and directed by Geoffrey S. Fletcher in his directorial debut after he won the Academy Award for Best Adapted Screenplay for Precious.\n- Violet & Daisy stars Saoirse Ronan, Alexis Bledel, Marianne Jean-Baptiste, Danny Trejo, and James Gandolfini.\n- James Gandolfini died on June 19, 2013, and Violet & Daisy was one of his last acting roles before his death.\n- Alexis Bledel was born on September 16, 1981, and is an American actress and model.\n- Alexis Bledel won a Primetime Emmy Award for her work on the Hulu drama series The Handmaid's Tale.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
